Prune stale cache tags and unused Git generations

Usage:
  flate cache gc [flags]

Flags:
      --cache-dir string       Prune this cache directory (required) [env: FLATE_CACHE_DIR]
      --dry-run[=true|false]   List cache entries to prune without deleting them [env: FLATE_DRY_RUN]
  -h, --help[=true|false]      help for gc
      --max-age duration       Prune cache entries unused for this duration (0 disables) [env: FLATE_MAX_AGE] (default 720h0m0s)

Global Flags:
      --log-level string           Set log level: debug,info,warn,error [env: FLATE_LOG_LEVEL] (default "error")
      --no-progress[=true|false]   Hide live progress on stderr [env: FLATE_NO_PROGRESS]
